Portuguese lexicon for Libre Tiles
Source: LibreOffice dictionaries pt_PT at commit 75f5dff8c972fff4a32e4ea8434722c277f02a3f
LibreOffice Portuguese (pt_PT) dictionary pack version 20.10.5.1
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only OR LGPL-2.1-only OR MPL-1.1

The word list is derived by expanding the upstream affix file, preserving c-cedilla
because it has its own tile, and folding every other marked letter; see the lexicon
header for why.

NOTE ON THE LICENCE: the two upstream documents below do not agree. README_pt_PT.txt
states that all dictionary files are covered by GPL 2 / LGPL 2.1 / MPL 1.1 in that
order; LICENSES.txt says, without versions, 'the GPL and BSD licence'. The SPDX
expression above follows the README because it is the specific, versioned statement
about the dictionary files themselves. BSD is deliberately not claimed. Both documents
are reproduced in full so the conflict is visible rather than resolved silently.

--- upstream README_pt_PT.txt ---

This is a Portuguese (Portugal) dictionary for Hunspell:

Copyright (C) 2006-2012  José João de Almeida <jj@di.uminho.pt> , 
	Rui Vilela <ruivilela@di.uminho.pt> ,
	Alberto Simões <ambs@di.uminho.pt>

Dep. Informática, Universidade do Minho
Portugal

All dictionary files and associated programs are currently covered by
the (GPL/LGPL/MPL), by this order. See also COPYING file for more
details, if available.

Regarding license versions: 
     1. GPL Version 2
     2. LGPL Version 2.1
     3. MPL Version 1.1

To install : Find a suitable application that uses myspell
    dictionaries like openoffice, or hunspell terminal aplication. Use
    the program dictionary application (if it has) for installing the
    dictionaries.  For openoffice, you should make sure that the
    dictionary.lst file has the following line: DICT pt PT pt_PT

Automatic instalation: You can automatically download our dictionary
using the available plugins, either from mozilla, or OpenOffice. See
our site for details.

Latest versions, suggestions, automatic install, informations at
       http://natura.di.uminho.pt/



